00:05:40.076 --> 00:05:43.603
<v Host>It means a penalty or punishment set by a rule.

00:05:44.204 --> 00:05:55.507
<v Slow>インターネットを使う人も、うその情報で選挙の公正を害してはいけないと、はっきり書かれました。

00:05:56.307 --> 00:06:03.435
<v Host>It clearly states that internet users, too, must not harm the fairness of elections with false information.

